SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The aaiioo__wwrriittee() system call is expected to conform to the IEEE Std 1003.1
     (“POSIX.1”) standard.

     The aaiioo__wwrriittee22() and aaiioo__wwrriitteevv() system calls are FreeBSD extensions,
     and should not be used in portable code.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The aaiioo__wwrriittee() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 3.0.  The
     aaiioo__wwrriitteevv() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 13.0.  The
     aaiioo__wwrriittee22() system call first appeared in FreeBSD 14.1.

